---
import Layout from "../layout.astro";

---
<Layout title="How We Work: SAGE™\u2122 and RIPL Portfolios | RIPL Wealth" description="See the RIPL client journey, four SAGE™\u2122 planning conversations, investment management, deliverables and fees before choosing your path.">
<section class="hero sage-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</div><h1>You have a plan for your career or your business.<br><span class="sage-hero-highlight ripl-gold">Let’s build one for your financial life.</span></h1><p class="lead">It starts with a conversation. From there, you choose one of two paths.</p><div class="page-actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a><a class="text-link" href="#client-path">See the steps ↓</a></div></div></section>




<section class="section questions sage-steps-section" id="client-path"><div class="wrap"><div class="sage-steps-intro"><div class="eyebrow">HOW IT GOES</div><h2>Two meetings, then you choose your path.</h2></div>
  <ol class="sage-steps start-steps">
    <li class="sage-step"><span class="sage-step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div class="sage-step-card"><div class="eyebrow">FIRST CONVERSATION</div><h3>Discovery Meeting</h3><p>We sit down, learn about you, and see if we think about money the same way.</p></div></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="behind"><div class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE SCENES, ON OUR SIDE</div><p>We collect the information we need to come up with ideas, strategies, and opportunities for you.</p></div>
  <ol class="sage-steps start-steps">
    <li class="sage-step"><span class="sage-step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div class="sage-step-card"><div class="eyebrow">DECISION POINT</div><h3>Proposal Meeting</h3><p>You meet our team. We share the value we could create and what it will cost. You choose how you’d like to move forward.</p></div></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="fork">
    <div class="fork-btns" role="tablist"><button role="tab" data-path="both" aria-selected="true" id="path-tab-both" aria-controls="path-panel-both" type="button"><b>SAGE™ + RIPL Portfolios</b><span>For those seeking full financial clarity and a revitalized portfolio structure.</span></button><button role="tab" data-path="pm" aria-selected="false" id="path-tab-pm" aria-controls="path-panel-pm" type="button"><b>RIPL Portfolios</b><span>For those seeking an upgrade to their investment structure.</span></button></div>
  </div>
  <div class="fork-views">


  <div data-pathview="both" id="path-panel-both" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="path-tab-both">
    
    <div class="sage-value-intro"><div class="eyebrow">WHAT SAGE™ BRINGS TOGETHER</div><h2>One financial life.<br><span class="ripl-gold">One coordinated plan.</span></h2><p>You are not paying for a binder that sits on a shelf. We work through the decisions competing for your attention, connect the people advising you, and give you a clear order for what happens next.</p><p>Your next dollar. Your next hour. Your next stage. The plan helps you decide where each belongs.</p></div><ol class="sage-steps">
      <li class="sage-step"><span class="sage-step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div class="sage-step-card"><div class="eyebrow">CONVERSATION 1</div><h3>Vision, Goals, and Team</h3><p>We talk through where you are today and get specific about what financial freedom actually looks like for you.</p><p>We connect your goals with the life you actually want: the work you want to keep doing, the time you want back, and the people you want to help. We identify the professionals who need to be involved and the decisions that cannot wait.</p><p class="sage-step-takeaway"><strong>What you leave with</strong>A clear picture of your goals, priorities, and advisory team.</p></div></li>
      <li class="sage-step"><span class="sage-step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div class="sage-step-card"><div class="eyebrow">CONVERSATION 2</div><h3>Financial Flow and Foundational Security</h3><p>We map how money moves through your life and walk through every risk that could get in the way.</p><p>We organize income, spending, debt and reserves so you can see what is genuinely available. We review insurance and other financial risks, then coordinate questions with the appropriate professionals.</p><p class="sage-step-takeaway"><strong>What you leave with</strong>A view of your cash flow, reserves, and the risks worth addressing.</p></div></li>
      <li class="sage-step"><span class="sage-step-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div class="sage-step-card"><div class="eyebrow">CONVERSATION 3</div><h3>Asset Alignment</h3><p>We go through every asset you hold to assess whether each one is creating appropriate value for you.</p><p>Business interests, cash, investments, retirement accounts and property belong in the same conversation. We map their purpose, timing, access and concentration, then connect your investment structure with the rest of your life.</p><p class="sage-step-takeaway"><strong>What you leave with</strong>A clearer purpose for your assets, connected to your goals and timelines.</p></div></li>
      <li class="sage-step"><span class="sage-step-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><div class="sage-step-card"><div class="eyebrow">CONVERSATION 4</div><h3>Value Maximization</h3><p>We bring you the 3 to 5 priorities that matter most this year, built around your situation.</p><p>We weigh the opportunities, costs and tradeoffs together. Your written priorities explain what to address first, why it matters and who needs to be involved. Tax and legal decisions are coordinated with your tax strategist and attorney.</p><p class="sage-step-takeaway"><strong>What you leave with</strong>A one-page priority plan and written summary, with three to five priorities for the year.</p></div></li>
      <li class="sage-step plain-step"><span class="sage-step-number" aria-hidden="true">05</span><div class="sage-step-card"><div class="eyebrow">AFTER THAT</div><h3>A Set Rhythm</h3><p>We meet on a set rhythm: a six-month check-in, an annual review, and a contact calendar built around your needs.</p><p>The plan is a starting point for an ongoing relationship. We revisit progress, changes in your life and the next decisions, rather than assuming last year’s priorities still fit.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  <p class="small">SAGE™ is offered with RIPL Portfolios, rather than as a standalone plan. The agreed scope depends on your situation and is described in your proposal and advisory agreement. RIPL coordinates with tax and legal professionals; it does not replace their services.</p></div>

  <div data-pathview="pm" id="path-panel-pm" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="path-tab-pm">
    
    <ol class="sage-steps">
      <li class="sage-step"><span class="sage-step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div class="sage-step-card"><div class="eyebrow">ONCE ASSETS LAND</div><h3>Onboarding Meeting</h3><p>One meeting, two parts, once every account has landed.</p><p class="sage-step-takeaway"><strong>Platform Walkthrough</strong>Gets you comfortable in the system.</p><p class="sage-step-takeaway"><strong>Strategy and Allocation</strong>Your investment strategy, start to finish.</p></div></li>
      <li class="sage-step plain-step"><span class="sage-step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div class="sage-step-card"><div class="eyebrow">AFTER THAT</div><h3>A Set Rhythm</h3><p>We meet on a set rhythm: a six-month check-in, an annual review, and a contact calendar built around your needs.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>
</div></section>


<section class="section questions"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">WHAT IT COSTS</div><h2>You see the cost before you decide.</h2>
  <div class="cost-grid">
    <div class="card"><span class="num">RIPL PORTFOLIOS</span><h3>An annual management fee.</h3><p>Based on the assets we manage for you.</p>
      <table class="fee-table"><thead><tr><th>Assets we manage</th><th>Annual fee</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Up to $1M</td><td>1.50%</td></tr><tr><td>$1M to $3M</td><td>1.25%</td></tr><tr><td>$3M to $5M</td><td>1.10%</td></tr><tr><td>$5M to $10M</td><td>1.00%</td></tr><tr><td>$10M to $25M</td><td>0.80%</td></tr><tr><td>$25M and up</td><td>Negotiable</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <div class="card"><span class="num">SAGE™ + RIPL PORTFOLIOS</span><h3>A planning fee, plus the management fee.</h3><p class="fee-big">$10,000 to $50,000</p><p>The cost of a plan depends on complexity, time, and the structure of what you’re asking us to do.</p><p>Every plan is quoted individually at the Proposal Meeting, matched to your specific situation and what can be added to the table.</p><p>The annual management fee is the same as RIPL Portfolios.</p><ul class="sage-includes"><li>Four structured planning conversations.</li><li>A connected view of your financial life and advisory team.</li><li>A one-page priority plan and written summary.</li><li>An investment structure connected to your goals.</li><li>A six-month check-in, annual review and contact calendar.</li></ul></div>
  </div>
  <p class="small pm-disc">The planning fee is separate from the annual investment management fee. Your proposal and agreement explain how fees apply to your accounts, billing and the agreed scope. Investment product expenses and other applicable costs may also apply. Full fee information is described in our Form ADV Part 2A.<a href="/disclosures/"> Read our disclosures.</a></p>
</div></section>

<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">RIPL PORTFOLIOS</div><h2>Every dollar<br>gets a job.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">Both paths use RIPL Portfolios. Your money is organized into three rings by when you need it: Today, Tomorrow, and Beyond.</p><a class="btn athlete-primary" href="/wealth/">Explore RIPL Portfolios</a></div></div></section>


<section class="section"><div class="wrap calculator-preview"><div><div class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE POSSIBILITIES</div><h2>What could time and consistency do?</h2><p>Try different amounts, contributions and timelines in our compound-interest calculator. It is an illustration, not your financial-freedom target.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/compound-interest-calculator/">Try the Calculator →</a></div></section><section class="section questions sage-closing"><div class="wrap"><h2>Let’s get your financial life organized.</h2><p class="lead">Start with a conversation about what you want to accomplish. We’ll explain both paths, what each would include, and what it costs before you decide.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a></div></section>

<script>import "../service-paths.js";</script>
</Layout>
